      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Video Tracking:</strong> Keep notes and track watch progress on videos</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Custom Tags & Notes:</strong> Add personal organization and annotations</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="line-height: 1.7; color: ${args.theme.var.color.text}; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: ${args.theme.var.color.info_light_100}; border-radius: 0.375rem; border-left: 3px solid ${args.theme.var.color.info};"><strong>Important:</strong> YSaar (KAPIL MULJIBHAI PIPALIYA) uses <strong>YouTube API Services</strong> to access publicly available YouTube data on your behalf through your personal Google OAuth authorization. We do not download, store, or redistribute YouTube video files.</p>
  `
